# Title: Regsvr32 DLL Execution With Uncommon Extension
# ID: 50919691-7302-437f-8e10-1fe088afa145
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2019-07-17
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.stealth, attack.t1574, attack.execution
# Description: Detects a "regsvr32" execution where the DLL doesn't contain a common file extension.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((Image="*\\regsvr32.exe") OR (OriginalFileName equals "REGSVR32.EXE")) AND NOT (((CommandLine equals "") OR ((CommandLine contains ".ax" OR CommandLine contains ".cpl" OR CommandLine contains ".dll" OR CommandLine contains ".ocx")) OR (NOT CommandLine=*))) AND NOT (((CommandLine contains ".bav") OR (CommandLine contains ".ppl"))))
